    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `extract_invoice_fields.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external provider for extracting fields from an invoice. I will use Amazon Textract, a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. This service is identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific client class `textract`. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865603571,
          "start": 1789865600575
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4da63f001QoVQehZ3562NN3",
